  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 18ed774de4a804c11a0022a931b929ad, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "T\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ECDc topology, ch\u1ECDn tuy\u1EBFn
    v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EE1; \u0111\u1ED1i x\u1EE9ng ch\u1EC9 l\xE0
    b\u1ED1 c\u1EE5c, kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ph\xE9p bi\u1EBFn h\xECnh hay l\u1EF1c m\u1EDBi.
    B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P04/P06/P08/P11/P12/P15/P19 \u2014 ba v\xF9ng h\xECnh h\u1ECDc
    r\xF5 d\u1EA5u h\u01B0\u1EDBng: v\xF2ng, g\xF3c chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1EE1 v\xE0
    l\u1ED3ng trong v\u1ECF \u0111\u1ED1i x\u1EE9ng.\nRecovery: M\u1ED7i v\xF9ng
    c\xF3 s\xE2n ngh\u1EC9 v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng quay l\u1EA1i ng\u1EAFn; d\u1EA5u
    h\xECnh v\xE0 m\xE0u c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh tr\xE1nh g\xE2y l\u1EA1c ch\u1EC9
    v\xEC hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng v\u1EA1n hoa"
